# Session scaffolding, not part of the app. These were the briefs and handoff
# notes the build ran on, and they carry homelab specifics (container ids,
# private addresses, internal hostnames) that have no business in a public
# repository. Kept on disk, out of the tree.
/handoff/
/ARCHITECT.md
/BUILDER.md
/REVIEWER.md
/new-setup.md
/.claude/
